亮问刁玄议罪、赦宫中基得免","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu059-a-dbf892b4b69d965eddb4","label":"正文","text":"基侍孙亮在内，太平二年盗乘御马收付狱；亮问侍中刁玄盗乘御马罪，玄对科应死并为基请哀原；亮论法不阿亲亲，从玄言赦宫中，基得免","evidence":["santizhu059-q-1118e5e9a01d19c98f6f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"santizhu-p0157","role":"盗乘御马被收付狱，因赦得免","evidence":["santizhu059-q-1118e5e9a01d19c98f6f"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0128","role":"问罪于刁玄并赦宫中","evidence":["santizhu059-q-1118e5e9a01d19c98f6f"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0021","role":"对以科应死并请哀原、言赦制","evidence":["santizhu059-q-1118e5e9a01d19c98f6f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu059-q-1118e5e9a01d19c98f6f"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu059-q-1118e5e9a01d19c98f6f","source_order":[59,230,0],"order":10486},{"id":"wufan-e-c098dacb4473a4b12fc5","title":"刘惇著书百余篇，刁玄称奇","accounts":[{"id":"wufan-a-c098dacb4473a4b12fc5","label":"正文","text":"刘惇著书百余篇，刁玄称奇","evidence":["wufan-q-e2909d1d1072ed5f7166"]},{"id":"wufan-a-18e7b8f92b37e6bb7e52","label":"正文","text":"刘惇著书百余篇","evidence":["wufan-q-e2909d1d1072ed5f7166"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wufan-p-68c6a8b7006d7d","role":"著书者","evidence":["wufan-q-e2909d1d1072ed5f7166"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0021","role":"称奇者","evidence":["wufan-q-e2909d1d1072ed5f7166"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wufan-q-e2909d1d1072ed5f7166"]},"ordering_evidence":"wufan-q-e2909d1d1072ed5f7166","order":10882}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0021","name":"刁玄","evidence":["santizhu-q-f7f766457156d7efc6be","santizhu-q-737d38cbed76797e17bd","santizhu-q-e3398c00b62a1624eb55","wufan-q-e2909d1d1072ed5f7166","wufan-q-7e05e0b92b8a569a18a9"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wufan-m-b6f1e57de38b636b0a78","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：名儒，称刘惇著书以为奇","evidence":["wufan-q-7e05e0b92b8a569a18a9"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-737d38cbed76797e17bd","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-9cfc363fb2c724ef4a90","layer":"pei","quote":"亮后出西苑，方食生梅；使黄门至中藏取蜜渍梅，蜜中有鼠矢。召问藏吏，藏吏叩头。亮问吏曰：‘黄门从汝求蜜邪？’吏曰：‘向求，实不敢与。’黄门不服。侍中刁玄、张邠启：‘黄门、藏吏辞语不同，请付狱推尽。’亮曰：‘此易知耳！’令破鼠矢，矢里燥。亮大笑谓玄、邠曰：‘若矢先在蜜中，中外当俱湿；今外湿里燥，必是黄门所为！’黄门首服，左右莫不惊悚。","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":116,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-7f51ee789134c097e810","start":52,"end":218},{"id":"santizhu-q-e3398c00b62a1624eb55","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-64506a3c295a43bcb7e9","layer":"pei","quote":"初，丹杨刁玄使蜀，得司马徽与刘廙论运命历数事。玄诈增其文以诳国人曰：‘黄旗紫盖，现于东南；终有天下者，荆、扬之君乎？’","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":421,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b6e96da1f7782bc817ec","start":11,"end":70},{"id":"santizhu-q-f7f766457156d7efc6be","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-db791b7bf69ac554e010","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，使五官中郎将刁玄，告乱于蜀","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":131,"end":148},{"id":"santizhu059-q-1118e5e9a01d19c98f6f","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-67c9b574ae699782ffe5","layer":"original","quote":"基侍孙亮在内。太平二年，盗乘御马，收付狱。亮问侍中刁玄曰：“盗乘御马，罪云何〖16〗？”玄对曰：“科应死〖17〗。然鲁王早终，惟陛下哀原之。”亮曰：“法者，天下所共，何得阿以亲亲故邪〖18〗！当思惟可以释此者，奈何以情相迫乎？”玄曰：“旧〖19〗，赦有大小；或天下，亦有千里、五百里赦：随意所及。”亮曰：“解人不当尔邪〖20〗！”乃赦宫中，基以得免。","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":229,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":175},{"id":"wufan-q-7e05e0b92b8a569a18a9","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-52e9049ea13a2705a189","layer":"original","quote":"名儒刁玄称以为奇","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":55,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":33,"end":41},{"id":"wufan-q-e2909d1d1072ed5f7166","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-52e9049ea13a2705a189","layer":"original","quote":"惇于诸术皆善，尤明太乙〖8〗；皆能推演其事，穷尽要妙。著书百余篇，名儒刁玄称以为奇。惇亦宝爱其术，不以告人；故世莫得而明也。","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":55,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":62}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
